{
    "prompt": "Generate a Knolling-style image. The scene features a blue backpack and a game controller, where the game controller is positioned to the right of the backpack, and the backpack is visually larger than the controller. A calculator is located above the game controller and is situated on the right side of the image. To the right of the calculator is a white cup. Above the cup is a pair of glasses, and strictly above the glasses is a pair of scissors. Finally, for every knife in the image, it is placed above the backpack.",
